{"product_id":"bad-luck-and-trouble","title":"Bad Luck And Trouble","description":"\u003cp\u003eYou DO NOT MESS with the Special Investigators!The events of 9\/11 changed Jack Reachers drifter life in a practical way. In addition to his folding toothbrush, he now needs to carry photo ID to get around. Yet he is still as close to untraceable as a human being in America can get.So when a member of his old Army unit manages to get a message to him, he knows it has to be deadly serious. The Special Investigators always watched each others backs. Now Reacher must put the old unit back together. Someone has killed one of them, and he cant let that go. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:106 x 174  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Lee Child \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780553818109 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 528\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41761682849945,"sku":"14RB9780553818109","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/f89feb5b1e78089ac6ed5d99ed9db66c.jpg?v=1700750447","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/bad-luck-and-trouble","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}